# Privacy Policy – Masar Al-Nujum

**Last Updated: October 2026**

Welcome to **Masar Al-Nujum** ("Masar Al-Nujum", "we", "us", or "our").

Masar Al-Nujum is a sports and talent-sharing platform that allows players to create profiles, upload and share videos showcasing their athletic skills, discover other players and talents, and interact with content within the platform.

This Privacy Policy explains how **QeemaTech** collects, uses, stores, protects, and may share information when you use the Masar Al-Nujum application.

By using Masar Al-Nujum, you acknowledge that you have read and understood this Privacy Policy.

