# 2. Camera, Photos, and Microphone Permissions

Masar Al-Nujum may request access to your device's camera, photos, videos, or microphone when you use features that require these permissions.

These permissions may be used to:

* Record player skill videos.
* Upload videos.
* Upload profile pictures.
* Select photos or videos from your device.
* Create or edit content.

We only access these resources when you grant the required permission and use a feature that requires them.

Masar Al-Nujum does not continuously record your camera or microphone in the background.

You can manage or revoke these permissions at any time through your device settings.

