# 3. Location Information

Certain features of Masar Al-Nujum may require location information.

If location services are used, they may help us provide features such as:

* Displaying your city or general location.
* Discovering players or sports-related content near you.
* Improving search results.
* Providing location-based recommendations.

We will only access your location when the relevant feature requires it and you have provided the necessary permission, where applicable.

You can disable location permissions through your device settings.

